# requirement 
pip install "fastapi[all]"
psycopg2

# FastAPI Instagram-Style Backend Service

A modular backend CRUD API built with **FastAPI** and **PostgreSQL**, structured according to production best practices with versioned routing and segregated schemas.

---
## System Flowchart & Architecture
                                  [ Incoming HTTP Request ]
                                              │
                                              ▼
                                         main.py
                            (Boots App & Mounts /api/v1 Router)
                                              │
                                              ▼
                                     api/v1/posts/router.py
                         (Route Handler: GET, POST, PUT, DELETE)
                                    /                 \
        [Validates Payload]        /                   \  [Fetches / Saves Data]
                                  ▼                     ▼
                        schemas.py                     models.py
                    (Pydantic V2 Models)         (SQLAlchemy ORM Model)
                   - PostCreate (Input)           - Table: "posts"
                   - PostResponse (Output)        - Columns: id, title, content,
                                                             published, created_at
                                                        │
                                                        ▼
                                                    database.py
                                           (Engine, SessionLocal, get_db)
                                                        │
                                                        ▼
                                                  PostgreSQL DB




## Project Architecture

```text
app/
├── api/
│   └── v1/
│       └── posts/
│           ├── __init__.py
│           ├── router.py       # Posts endpoints (/api/v1/posts)
│           └── schemas.py      # Pydantic models for validation
│
├── db/
│   ├── __init__.py
│   └── database.py             # PostgreSQL connection & cursor handling
│
├── main.py                     # Minimal application entrypoint
├── requirements.txt
└── README.md


uvicorn main: app --reload
